{"unit_id":"chai1110__dsh-ssh-remote#card-zh","repo":"chai1110/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"7cd4f937945a275b56fc533e4d3d910075ea2564","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 是面向 DSH Web 的 SSH 远程工作区插件，可在设置面板管理多台服务器，并让 Agent 对选定主机操作文件。它提供 SSH 主机注册与切换、工作区选择、目录浏览、文件读写和远程命令工具；还可用 SFTP 在远程目录与本机镜像间同步，并配置端口转发。适合需要从 DSH Web 维护远程开发机或多个 SSH 工作区的用户。需提供 SSH 主机和登录方式，无需 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:629-675","lib/index.js:793-855","lib/index.js:881-975","lib/client.js:701-714"]}
{"unit_id":"chai1110__dsh-ssh-remote#card-en","repo":"chai1110/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"7cd4f937945a275b56fc533e4d3d910075ea2564","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ssh-remote lets DSH Web manage SSH hosts and remote workspaces. Agent tools connect or switch hosts, browse and edit files, and run remote commands. SFTP syncs a remote workspace with a local mirror; SSH port forwarding is available. Requires an SSH host and login method; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:629-675","lib/index.js:793-855","lib/index.js:881-975","lib/client.js:701-714"]}
{"unit_id":"chai1110__dsh-ssh-remote#feature-1","repo":"chai1110/dsh-ssh-remote","commit":"7cd4f937945a275b56fc533e4d3d910075ea2564","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-remote 的功能「多主机管理」：通过 Agent 工具注册或重连 SSH 主机、查看连接状态，并切换当前主机；其他工具也可通过 machineId 指定目标。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:629-763"]}
